From: anyingiit <49945850+anyingiit@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 19:55:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] test: pin the fail-closed contract directly instead of
 probing for it (#682)

RawKvBatchUnresolvedKeyTest and CommitPrewriteKeyCoverageTest probed
whether RegionResolver::batchResolveRegions() fails closed (#244) and
kept a placeholder branch - expectNotToPerformAssertions() and an
E_USER_WARNING - for the case where it does not. #244 is merged, so the
branch was dead, and a regression of the contract would have made the
tests pass without running their assertions.

Both files now pin the contract with a direct expectException() test and
drop the probe, and the dependent tests run unconditionally.

Closes #682
---
 CHANGELOG.md                                  |  4 ++
 .../RawKv/RawKvBatchUnresolvedKeyTest.php     | 67 ++++++-------------
 .../TxnKv/CommitPrewriteKeyCoverageTest.php   | 40 +++++------
 3 files changed, 44 insertions(+), 67 deletions(-)

